  "body": "**Link to problem area**: None\r\n\r\n**Issue**\r\n\r\nI can't find any part of the v1.1 spec that mentions that `m.key.verification.request` is a possible `msgtype` for `m.room.message` and that the `m.key.verification.request` reference in `relates_to` is actually the event ID of an `m.room.message` event (not a `m.key.verification.request` event).",
